    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_eri7SD5xzmsNMB7W",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Join <strong>over 50,000 people worldwide</strong> who’ve kicked bad habits <strong>naturally</strong> with <strong>Lio®&apos;s</strong> non-electric, <strong>nicotine-free</strong> technology. Just <strong>breathe in flavored air</strong>, infused with <strong>natural ingredients</strong>, and turn cravings into <strong>refreshing moments of relief</strong>. <strong>Healthy</strong>, <strong>simple</strong>, and <strong>always ready</strong>.</h3>"
